 * Add this library to your project
   * Declare the Gradle repository in your root `build.gradle`

     ```gradle
     allprojects {
         repositories {
             maven { url "https://jitpack.io" }
         }
     }
     ```

   * Declare the Gradle dependency in your app module's `build.gradle`

